    {
      "source": "DeFiHackLabs",
      "text": "Donate Inflation ExchangeRate && Rounding Error. Lost: ~$260K"
    },
    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "On October 13, 2023, WiseLending on Ethereum Mainnet was exploited for approximately $260,000 due to a share rounding and accounting error. The attacker artificially inflated share value through a donation, then exploited a conversion bug to drain pool assets. The protocol's share accounting allowed a user to manipulate share value by direct token donation, then extract excess assets due to unsafe rounding in the share-to-token conversion logic. Withdrawal and loan calculations operated on mismatched units."
    }
  ],
